@title  PCSE00023 - reach the first fight WITHOUT skipping the pre-fight intros, then FIGHT
@game   PCSE00023
# fight-hard.recipe's front end, minus its f1850/f2000 cross presses: those cut Scorpion's
# intro short and skipped Jax's entirely (round 1 was on screen by f2025), so no run ever
# measured the intro frames. Here the VS screen and BOTH intros play out; the attack
# inputs are fight-hard's, shifted by 400 frames to start once round 1 is live.
0: @todo no @assert yet - this recipe is judged by its shots, so conformance has nothing
0: @todo to check. A watched round timer or health value would give it one.
0: @section boot
